sally-sales: OmniBank POC failing: TS SDK stream behind Bluecoat proxy gets 'socket hang up' ~30s. Can we swarm?
kevin-support: Likely proxy idle timeout or Connection: close injection. Ask for pcap + response headers.
sally-sales: Got a snippet from them:
> const client = new RedwoodClient({ apiKey: process.env.R_API });
> await client.chat.stream({ model: 'rwd-3-small', messages });
// errors after ~30s
anna-devex: If they can add deps, recommend an http.Agent with keepAlive:true. Quick example:
> import { Agent } from 'http';
> const agent = new Agent({ keepAlive: true });
> client.chat.stream(..., { fetch: (u, o) => fetch(u, { ...o, agent }) });
mike-eng: They said locked image, no extra deps. Short-term: switch to polling/chunked mode. Medium-term: we can canary an auto-fallback/resume feature.
deploy-bot: canary started: stream-resume-flag -> infra-canary-6
omni-bank-ic: Uploading pcap now.
kevin-support: pcap shows FIN from proxy at ~29.9s. Looks like idle timeout. We'll sanitize and share.
jess-security: If they want a dedicated connector, I'll draft a security checklist (KMS, audit logs, egress IPs).
sally-sales: Need rough POC pricing for 1 week dedicated connector. Anna, can you ballpark?
anna-devex: Ballpark: small ephemeral Dedicated pool (2x A10G equiv) + egress. I'll ping billing for formal quote.
kevin-support: Immediate workaround: provide TS/Python polling snippets and offer to enable a STREAM_AUTO_FALLBACK per-api-key flag while we ship SDK patch.
sally-sales: Told OmniBank we'll aim for workaround in 24-48h. Thanks team :thumbsup:
